  <para style="mt1">Filimọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm ye Akam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Ami Pọọl, awo ñkpakọb Krais Yisọs, ye Timoti ayịneka ñnyịn inọọ ñwed ami esọk Filimọn, adima ufan ye nsañautom ñnyịn. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />Inọ ñwed ami ñko esọk Afia, ayịneka ñnyịn awonwaan, ye Akipus, emọ-emọ awo ekọñ ñnyịn, ye ufọkabasi e-esisooboke ke ufọk mfo. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Yak mfọn ye emem etooho Abasi Ete, ye Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais, eba ye ndufo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ami mmesikọọm Abasi mmi ubaña fiin afịd ini a-ami mbọññọ akam. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Sia mmekop mbaña mbuọdidem a-afo anieghe ke Abọọñ Yisọs, ye ima a-anieghe anọọ afịd ndisana ikọd amọ. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ami mbọñ akam mbo Abasi unọ fiin ukeme adika iso ke utom ewuana ami ke mbuọdidem, anyʌñ unọ fiin ifiọk a-abañake afịd nti ñkpọ a-ñnyịn iwuanake ato ke Krais. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ima mfo annọ miin ataa idadesịd ye nsọọñọnda, sia afo, ayịneka mmi ke Krais, amedemme esịd ikọd Abasi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Akpeubọk Abaña Onesimọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Akpesʌkado ami mmenie ayọhọ unen ke Krais adubo fiin anam mme ñkpọ se idot, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ado ke ntak ima ami mmekappa ukpekpeiye fiin, ami Pọọl, akaanadeen ye awo ñkpakọb Krais Yisọs. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Ami ukpe fiin ubọk mbaña ayịn mmi Onesimọs, a-akekappake ado ayịn mmi idaha a-ami ñkesịneke ke ñkpakọb. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ke ini a-akeboiyoke anye ikibaaha ufọn unọ fiin, ado idahami anye a-aba ufọn unọ fiin, anyʌñ aba ufọn annọ miin.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Mmenọ anye a-ami nsiooho afịd esịd mmi mma nte atịmme ubịne fiin. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ami ñkpaakema anye aba mi ye ami nọ anye adat itie mfo ke adiñnwam miin ke ini ñkpọnọ asʌkkọ andọñọ miin ke ukod ato ke ntak adikwọrọ eti etob Krais. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ado ami ñkiyemme adinam ntoro ke miitooho ke unyịmme mfo, mbaak mfọnido mfo aditie nte unyeenyịk. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Adikidiañña anye ukpọñ fiin ke etək-etək ini akeme ido akedo nọ anye amaana atịmme adi adiba ye afo ke nsi-nsi, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />idooho aba nte afʌn, ado se ikpon ikan ado, nte adima ayịneka. Ami mmema anye eti-eti, ado anye ayaafọn ye afo akan, nte emọ-emọ awo ye nte ayịneka ke Abọọñ.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Ke ntoro, adieke afo ambatta miin nte awo nsaña utom mfo, daara anye ukem-ukem naña afo akpendaara miin. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Akpedo anye u-udue fiin ke usʌñ keed akeedodo anyʌñ ado anye u-ukama fiin isʌñ, bat afịd ado nnọ miin. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ami Pọọl, ndat ubọk mmi ñwet nte ke mmenwọñọ ke ñyaakpọñ unọ. Kpa ye ado afo ameñkama miin isʌñ akponno akan ado, a-adooho idem mfo. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ke ntom, ayịneka mmi ke Krais, nam ami ñkịt mfọn uto fiin, nyʌñ nam ñkpọ inemesịd nnọ miin ke Krais. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ami ñwet ñwed ami ye afịd idodanyen nte ke afo ayaanam se mbeeñe ami; ke amenyʌñ akan adinam ñkan naña ami mbeeñe.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ndin ñkpọ keed mfen; beeñe ubeed asenawo nịm nnọ miin; sia mmeduak ntịmme ñnyọñ ubịne fiin nte ibọrọ akam mfo.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Ebafras, emọ-emọ awo ñkpakọb mmi ke ntak Krais Yisọs, anọ ekọọm.<verse eid="PHM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Maak ñko, Aristakus, Demas ye Luk, mme nsaña utom mmi, e-enọ ekọọm.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais aba ye Sịbidịd ndufo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>